        "fgColor": "#FF7777"
      },
      "requiredCount": 5,
      "activation": "anticipateGaps",
      "countMode": {
        "perRule": false,
        "perSet": false,
        "perFaction": true,
        "perMainStat": false,
        "perSlot": true
      },
      "ignorePreviousSafeguards_v2": false,
      "ignoreEquippedInCollection": false,
      "ignoreEquippedInVault": false,
      "tuple": {
        "slots": [
          "Ring",
          "Amulet",
          "Banner"
        ],
        "sets": [],
        "metaSetNames": [],
        "ranks": [
          "4★",
          "5★",
          "6★"
        ],
        "rarities": [
          "Rare",
          "Epic",
          "Legendary",
          "Mythical"
        ],
        "mainStats": [],
        "factions": []
      },
      "tags": [
        "fw_coverage",
        "fw_count"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "SafeguardsEnabled": true,
  "RecipesEnabled": true,
  "Note": [
    "<span data-color=\"red\">**Use at your own risk.**</span> <span data-color=\"orange\">Your account may differ significantly from the one this file was built on.</span>  ",
    "<span data-color=\"green\">It's recommended to use this file alongside the real **RSL Helper** database. This helps retain **unique** gear pieces (gear pieces you own few copies of). See the **Help** section to learn how to import the database into **RSL Helper Sellfile Creator**.</span>  ",
    "",
    "<span data-color=\"white\">In this file, we provide cutomizable overrides so you can tune the behavior for your own account.",
    "</span> ",
    "",
    "---",
    "These overrides set sensible defaults for your account progression. You can still fine-tune everything below or edit individual rules (recipes & safeguards) after disabling the overrides in this dialog. ",
    "<!-- recipe-overrides [columns=4]",
    "  q \"Which account level do you think you have?\"",
    "  cb \"`Midgame`\" \"I can clear most **Normal** game modes and dungeons up to level 25.\\nI aim for **5★ Rare** gear and higher.\" id=midgame ^midgame +keep_general +keep_limited +keep_acc +keep_spd +keep_safeguards +rolls_22 +acc_rolls_22 +marius_open +fwh_no +la_no +eg_no +acc_early_no +ore5_epic +ore5_legendary +ore5_mythical -ore5_lvlcap +ore5_nbr +ore6_epic +ore6_legendary +ore6_mythical -ore6_lvlcap +ore6_nbr -ore6as_epic -ore6as_legendary +ore6as_mythical -ore6as_lvlcap +ore6as_nbr {}",
    "  cb \"`Lategame`\" \"I can clear all **Normal** game modes and most stages in any **Hard** mode.\\nI aim for **6★ Epic** and higher artifacts, and very good **5★** accessories.\" * id=lategame ^lategame -keep_general +keep_limited +keep_acc +keep_spd +keep_safeguards +rolls_33 +acc_rolls_32 +marius_finished +fwh_no +la_no +eg_no +acc_early_no +ore5_epic +ore5_legendary +ore5_mythical +ore5_lvlcap +ore5_nbr +ore6_epic +ore6_legendary +ore6_mythical -ore6_lvlcap +ore6_nbr -ore6as_epic -ore6as_legendary +ore6as_mythical -ore6as_lvlcap +ore6as_nbr {}",
    "  cb \"`Endgame`\" \"I can finish all **Hard** game modes including **Cursed City** / **Soulcross** and **Faction Wars.**\\nI aim for **6★ Epic** and higher artifacts, and very good **5★** accessories.\" id=endgame ^endgame -keep_general +keep_limited +keep_acc +keep_spd -keep_safeguards +rolls_43 +acc_rolls_33 +marius_finished +fwh_yes16 +la_yes16 +eg_early +acc_early_yesspider +ore5_epic +ore5_legendary +ore5_mythical +ore5_lvlcap -ore5_nbr +ore6_epic +ore6_legendary +ore6_mythical +ore6_lvlcap +ore6_nbr -ore6as_epic -ore6as_legendary +ore6as_mythical -ore6as_lvlcap +ore6as_nbr {}",
    "  cb \"`Endgame+`\" \"If you really want to get rid of more.\" id=endgameplus ^endgameplus +keep_safeguards -keep_general -keep_limited -keep_acc -keep_spd +marius_finished +rolls_43 +acc_rolls_43 +fwh_yes +la_yes +eg_yes +acc_early_yes -ore5_epic -ore5_legendary +ore5_mythical -ore5_lvlcap -ore5_nbr -ore6_epic -ore6_legendary +ore6_mythical -ore6_lvlcap -ore6_nbr -ore6as_epic -ore6as_legendary -ore6as_mythical -ore6as_lvlcap -ore6as_nbr {}",
    "-->",
    "<!-- recipe-overrides [columns=1]",
    "-->",
    "---",
    "<span data-color=\"orange\">**Optional 1**</span>: You can also customize the above settings in more detail here:",
    "<!-- recipe-overrides [columns=1]",
    "  q \"How strict should keeping `5★` gear be?\\nBy default the file keeps `6★` plus the `5★` that is hardest to replace — limited sets, accessories, and SPD. Unchecking a box keeps that category at `6★` only.\"",
    "  cb \"`Keep general 5★ gear`\" \"Also keep 5★ from any set, not just the hard-to-replace ones below.\" id=keep_general set keep_limited keep_acc keep_spd keep_safeguards { @rank=6 && !tag=ore6mythical && !tag=ore6legendary && !tag=ore6epic && !tag=ore5mythical && !tag=ore5legendary && !tag=ore5epic && !tag=ore6legendary_allsets { rank>=5 } @all { minima.any=5 } @tag=notmidgame { export=disabled } @tag=midgame { export=active } }",
    "  cb \"`Keep 5★ limited sets`\" \"Stoneskin, Mercurial, Feral etc. Artifacts only.\" id=keep_limited { else { @tag=limited { rank=6 } } }",
    "  cb \"`Keep 5★ accessories`\" \"Rings, amulets, banners.\" id=keep_acc { else { @tag=acc5 { rank=6 } } }",
    "  cb \"`Keep 5★ speed gear`\" \"SPD artifacts and banners, any set.\" id=keep_spd { else { @tag=spd_any { rank=6 } } }",
    "  cb \"`Keep 5★ safeguards`\" \"Let the safety-net reserve 5★ artifacts too.\" id=keep_safeguards { else { safeguard @tag=debuffer { rank=6 } safeguard @tag=damage { rank=6 } safeguard @tag=survivability { rank=6 } safeguard @tag=utility { rank=6 } safeguard @tag=catchrest { rank=6 } } }",
    "-->",
    "<!-- recipe-overrides [columns=1]",
    "  q \"Are you done with all progressive missions for Marius?\\nRegardless of your answer, exceptionally good pieces are always protected.\"",
    "  rb \"`No`\" \"Protect all Impulse and Zeal drops\" id=marius_open { @tag=marius { export=active } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes`\" \"Allow auto-sell for weak Impulse and Zeal drops\" id=marius_finished { @tag=marius { export=disabled } }",
    "-->",
    "<!-- recipe-overrides [columns=1]",
    "  q \"How many good substats does an artifact need to be worth keeping?\"",
    "  rb \"`Very relaxed`\" \"All artifacts need only **2** good substats.\" id=rolls_22 { @lockedminrolls=4 { lockedminrolls=2 } @lockedminrolls=3 { lockedminrolls=2 } @minrolls=4 { minrolls=2 } @minrolls=3 { minrolls=2 } @minsubstats=4 { minsubstats=2 } @minsubstats=3 { minsubstats=2 } @all { autolate=rare } }",
    "  rb \"`Relaxed`\" \"Defensive and support artifacts needs **3** good substats; everything else only **2**.\" id=rolls_32 { @lockedminrolls=4 { lockedminrolls=3 } @lockedminrolls=3 { lockedminrolls=2 } @minrolls=4 { minrolls=3 } @minrolls=3 { minrolls=2 } @minsubstats=4 { minsubstats=3 } @minsubstats=3 { minsubstats=2 } @all { autolate=rare } }",
    "  rb \"`Strict`\" \"All artifacts need at least **3** good substats.\" id=rolls_33 { @lockedminrolls=4 { lockedminrolls=3 } @minrolls=4 { minrolls=3 } }",
    "  rb \"`Very Strict`\" \"Defensive and support artifacts need **4** good substats; offensive artifacts need **3**. Limited Sets and set-bonus rules always cap at **3** regardless.\" * id=rolls_43 {}",
    "-->",
    "<!-- recipe-overrides [columns=1]",
    "  q \"How many good substats does an accessory (ring, amulet, banner) need to be worth keeping?\"",
    "  rb \"`Very relaxed`\" \"All accessories need only **2** good substats.\" id=acc_rolls_22 { @tag=acc and lockedminrolls=3 { lockedminrolls=2 } @tag=acc and minrolls=3 { minrolls=2 } @tag=acc and minsubstats=3 { minsubstats=2 } @tag=acc and substatmin=2 { substatmin=1 } @tag=acc and substatmin=3 { substatmin=2 } @tag=acc { autolate=rare } }",
    "  rb \"`Relaxed`\" \"Standard spider accessories need **3** good substats; everything else only **2**.\" id=acc_rolls_32 { }",
    "  rb \"`Strict`\" \"All accessories need at least **3** good substats.\" id=acc_rolls_33 { @tag=acc and lockedminrolls=2 { lockedminrolls=3 } @tag=acc and minrolls=2 { minrolls=3 } @tag=acc and substatmin.SPD=1 { substatmin.SPD=2 } @tag=acc and substatmin=2 { substatmin=3 } } ",
    "  rb \"`Very Strict`\" \"Standard spider accessories need **4** good substats; everything else only **3**.\" id=acc_rolls_43 { @tag=acc and lockedminrolls=3 { lockedminrolls=4 } @tag=acc and lockedminrolls=2 { lockedminrolls=3 } @tag=acc and minrolls=3 { minrolls=4 } @tag=acc and minrolls=2 { minrolls=3 } @tag=acc and substatmin=3 { substatmin=4 } @tag=acc and substatmin=2 { substatmin=3 } @tag=acc and substatmin=1 { substatmin=2 } } ",
    "--><br>",
    "<!-- recipe-overrides [columns=1]",
    "  q \"Did you finish Faction Wars in Hard mode?\\nThis affects **Stun**, **Provoke**, **Toxic**, and similar utility sets.\\nRegardless of your answer, exceptionally good pieces are always protected.\"",
    "  rb \"`No`\" \"Keep these sets at any level (0–16)\" id=fwh_no { @tag=utility { export=active lvl=0-16 } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes`\" \"Keep only level 16 pieces from these sets\" id=fwh_yes16 { @tag=utility { export=active lvl=16 gearsets=+-Daze } safeguard @tag=utility { rank=6 rarity=legendary,mythical } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes!`\" \"No extra protection — treat like any other gear\" id=fwh_yes { @tag=utility { export=disabled } safeguard @tag=utility { activation=off } }",
    "-->",
    "<!-- recipe-overrides [columns=1]",
    "  q \"Do you play and win Live Arena and Siege a lot?\\nThis affects **Zeal**, **Impulse**, **Feral**, **Stonecleaver**, and **Rebirth** drops.\\nRegardless of your answer, exceptionally good pieces are always protected.\"",
    "  rb \"`No`\" \"Keep all drops from these sets\" id=la_no { @tag=scarce { export=active lvl=0-16 } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes`\" \"Keep pieces from these sets already at level 16\" id=la_yes16 { @tag=scarce { export=active lvl=16 } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes!`\" \"No extra protection for these sets\" id=la_yes { @tag=scarce { export=disabled } }",
    "-->",
    "<!-- recipe-overrides [columns=1]",
    "  q \"Can you consistently clear all hard dungeons (stage 10) **and** all stages of Cursed City Hard?\\nThis affects how strictly average drops from most gear sets are evaluated.\\nExceptionally good pieces are always protected regardless.\"",
    "  rb \"`No`\" \"Keep weaker drops at any level (0–16).\" id=eg_no { @tag=setbonus { export=active lvl=0-16 } }",
    "  rb \"`Mostly`\" \"Keep drops that already look promising by **level 12**.\" id=eg_early { @tag=setbonus { keep=early } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes`\" \"Keep pieces already at level 16.\" id=eg_yes16 { @tag=setbonus { export=active lvl=16 } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes!`\" \"No special protection — treat like any other gear.\" id=eg_yes { @tag=setbonus { export=disabled } }",
    "-->",
    "<!-- recipe-overrides [columns=1]",
    "  q \"Do you generally have too many accessories and want to sell them early on?\\n9-piece sets have lower substat requirements by default. This also applies to accessories. As a result, it's possible to own too many, which either depletes your silver or fills up your vault space.\"",
    "  rb \"`No`\" \"Use default setup.\" id=acc_early_no { }",
    "  rb \"`Mostly`\" \"Spider accessories and **5★** must roll desired stats early.\" id=acc_early_yesspider { @tag=acc and !tag=acc6 { keep=early rolltarget.HP=300,600,900,1200,1500,1500 rolltarget.ATK=20,40,60,80,100,100 rolltarget.DEF=20,40,60,80,100,100 } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes`\" \"All accessories must roll desired stats early.\" id=acc_early_yes { @tag=acc { keep=early rolltarget.HP=300,600,900,1200,1500,1500 rolltarget.ATK=20,40,60,80,100,100 rolltarget.DEF=20,40,60,80,100,100 } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes!`\" \"Rely mostly on Safeguards for selling accessories.\" id=acc_early_veryyes { @tag=acc { keep=early rolltarget.HP=300,600,900,1200,1500,1500 rolltarget.ATK=20,40,60,80,100,100 rolltarget.DEF=20,40,60,80,100,100 } @tag=acc5 { export=disabled } @tag=acc6 { export=disabled } @tag=acc_flat { export=disabled } }",
    "-->",
    "Sometimes a gear piece is practically useless because of bad stats, yet the gear set is useful and we might want to consider using `Chaos Ore` to `rework` it later with a chance to get 3× or 4× in the `Speed` substat.",
    "<!-- recipe-overrides",
    "  q \"Keep weak `5★` pieces to rework with `Chaos Ore` later?",
    "For scarce sets like **Merciless**, **Stoneskin**, and **Mercurial**, and sets with a Speed bonus.\\nPick which rarities to keep.\"",
    "  cb \"Keep **Epic** pieces\" id=ore5_epic { @tag=ore5epic { export=active keep=early } else { @tag=ore5epic { export=disabled } } }",
    "  cb \"Keep **Legendary** pieces\" id=ore5_legendary { @tag=ore5legendary { export=active keep=early } else { @tag=ore5legendary { export=disabled } } }",
    "  cb \"Keep **Mythical** pieces\" id=ore5_mythical { @tag=ore5mythical { export=active keep=early } else { @tag=ore5mythical { export=disabled } } }",
    "  cb \"Keep only pieces already at **level 12–16**\" id=ore5_lvlcap needs ore5_epic ore5_legendary ore5_mythical { @tag=ore5epic { lvl=12-16 } @tag=ore5legendary { lvl=12-16 } @tag=ore5mythical { lvl=12-16 } }",
    "  cb \"Ignore Gauntlets, Chestplates, and Boots\" id=ore5_nbr needs ore5_epic ore5_legendary ore5_mythical { @tag=ore5epic { slots=Weapon,Helmet,Shield,Ring,Amulet,Banner } @tag=ore5legendary { slots=Weapon,Helmet,Shield,Ring,Amulet,Banner } @tag=ore5mythical { slots=Weapon,Helmet,Shield,Ring,Amulet,Banner } }",
    "-->",
    "<!-- recipe-overrides",
    "  q \"Keep weak `6★` pieces to rework with `Chaos Ore` later?",
    "For scarce sets like **Merciless**, **Stoneskin**, and **Mercurial**, and sets with a Speed bonus.\\nPick which rarities to keep.\"",
    "  cb \"Keep **Epic** pieces\" id=ore6_epic { @tag=ore6epic { export=active keep=early } else { @tag=ore6epic { export=disabled } } }",
    "  cb \"Keep **Legendary** pieces\" id=ore6_legendary { @tag=ore6legendary { export=active keep=early } else { @tag=ore6legendary { export=disabled } } }",
    "  cb \"Keep **Mythical** pieces\" id=ore6_mythical { @tag=ore6mythical { export=active keep=early } else { @tag=ore6mythical { export=disabled } } }",
    "  cb \"Keep only pieces already at **level 12–16**\" id=ore6_lvlcap needs ore6_epic ore6_legendary ore6_mythical { @tag=ore6epic { lvl=12-16 } @tag=ore6legendary { lvl=12-16 } @tag=ore6mythical { lvl=12-16 } }",
    "  cb \"Ignore Gauntlets, Chestplates, and Boots\" id=ore6_nbr needs ore6_epic ore6_legendary ore6_mythical { @tag=ore6epic { slots=Weapon,Helmet,Shield,Ring,Amulet,Banner } @tag=ore6legendary { slots=Weapon,Helmet,Shield,Ring,Amulet,Banner } @tag=ore6mythical { slots=Weapon,Helmet,Shield,Ring,Amulet,Banner } }",
    "-->",
    "<!-- recipe-overrides",
    "  q \"Keep weak `6★` pieces to rework with `Chaos Ore` later?",
    "For **any** gear set, not just the scarce ones above.\\nPick which rarities to keep.\"",
    "  cb \"Keep **Epic** pieces\" id=ore6as_epic set ore6as_legendary ore6as_mythical { @tag=ore6legendary_allsets { substatmin=3 } }",
    "  cb \"Keep **Legendary** pieces\" id=ore6as_legendary set ore6as_mythical { else { @tag=ore6legendary_allsets { substatmin=5 } } }",
    "  cb \"Keep **Mythical** pieces\" id=ore6as_mythical { @tag=ore6legendary_allsets { export=active lvl=0-16 } else { @tag=ore6legendary_allsets { export=disabled } } }",
    "  cb \"Keep only pieces already at **level 12–16**\" id=ore6as_lvlcap needs ore6as_epic ore6as_legendary ore6as_mythical { @tag=ore6legendary_allsets { lvl=12-16 } }",
    "  cb \"Ignore Gauntlets, Chestplates, and Boots\" id=ore6as_nbr needs ore6as_epic ore6as_legendary ore6as_mythical { @tag=ore6legendary_allsets and !substatmin.SPD>=4 { slots=Weapon,Helmet,Shield,Ring,Amulet,Banner } @tag=ore6legendary_allsets and substatmin.SPD>=4 { export=disabled } }",
    "-->",
    "<!-- recipe-overrides [columns=1]",
    "-->",
    "---",
    "<span data-color=\"orange\">**Optional 2**</span>: **Safeguards are a safety net on top of the standard rules.** They make sure you always keep a minimum number of certain types of gear — even when none of the standard keep recipes matched the piece.  ",
    "For Safeguards to work, you *must* connect the Sellfile Creator with RSL Helper, or manually load its DB! Otherwise the Safeguards have simply no effect at all.",
    "<!-- safeguard-overrides [columns=2]",
    "  q \"How many of the best SPD banners **per faction** should always be protected (across all sets)?\"",
    "  slider \"\" min=1 max=64 default=16 { @tag=spd { count=$value/8 } @tag=spd_fallback { count=$value } }",
    "-->",
    "<!-- safeguard-overrides [columns=2]",
    "  q \"How many speed-set pieces **per slot** should be protected?\"",
    "  slider \"\" min=1 max=64 default=16 { @tag=speed_set { count=$value/2 } @tag=speed_set_fallback { count=$value } }",
    "--><br>",
    "<!-- safeguard-overrides [columns=2]",
    "  q \"How many debuffer pieces **per slot** should be protected?\"",
    "  slider \"\" min=1 max=64 default=32 { @tag=debuffer { count=$value/16 } @tag=debuffer_fallback { count=$value } }",
    "-->",
    "<!-- safeguard-overrides [columns=2]",
    "  q \"How many damage or survivability pieces **per slot** and **per main stat** should be protected?\"",
    "  slider \"\" min=1 max=64 default=32 { @tag=survivability { count=$value/16 } @tag=survivability_fallback { count=$value } @tag=damage_primary { count=$value/12 } @tag=damage_fallback { count=$value } }",
    "--><br>",
    "<!-- safeguard-overrides [columns=2]",
    "  q \"How many damage/survivability/debuffer pieces **per slot** and **per main stat** of **Mercurial** should be protected?\"",
    "  slider \"\" min=1 max=64 default=8 { @tag=mercurial4 { count=$value/2 } @tag=mercurial8 { count=$value } }",
    "-->",
    "<!-- safeguard-overrides [columns=2]--><br>",
    "<!-- safeguard-overrides [columns=4]",
    "  q \"Do you want to protect **artifacts** (not accessories) by its **improvement chance**?\\nIn addition to protecting your current best gear, we can also protect gear which has a chance to become better than what you already own. \"",
    "  rb \"`No`\" \"I want above amounts to be interpreted strictly.\" { @tagged { improvchance=disabled } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes ~12.5%`\" \"Protect artifacts with ≥ 3% (on level 0) to 12.5% (on level 12) chance to be better than what I have.\" { @tagged { improvchance=3,3,6,12.5 } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes ~25%`\" \"Protect artifacts with ≥ 3% (on level 0) - 25% (on level 12) chance to be better than what I have.\" * { @tagged { improvchance=3,6,12,25 } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes ~50%`\" \"Protect artifacts with ≥ 6% (on level 0) - 50% (on level 12) chance to be better than what I have.\" { @tagged { improvchance=6,12,25,50 } }",
    "--><br>",
    "<!-- safeguard-overrides [columns=4]",
    "  q \"Do you want to protect **accessories** by its **improvement chance**?\"",
    "  rb \"`No`\" \"I want above amounts to be interpreted strictly.\" { @tag=acc { improvchance=disabled } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes ~12.5%`\" \"Protect accessories with ≥ 3% (on level 0) to 12.5% (on level 12) chance to be better than what I have.\" { @tag=acc { improvchance=3,3,6,12.5 } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes ~25%`\" \"Protect accessories with ≥ 3% (on level 0) - 25% (on level 12) chance to be better than what I have.\" * { @tag=acc { improvchance=3,6,12,25 } }",
    "  rb \"`Yes ~50%`\" \"Protect accessories with ≥ 6% (on level 0) - 50% (on level 12) chance to be better than what I have.\" { @tag=acc { improvchance=6,12,25,50 } }",
    "--><br>",
    "---",
    "Ignoring the dynamic nature of Safeguards — above settings will result in about this amount of gear pieces kept:",
    "<!-- dungeon-simulator -->",
    "---",
    "# Understanding this Sell File",
    "",
    "## What is this sell file?",
    "This is a **keep-list**: every gear piece is auto-sold unless it matches a keep recipe. RSL Helper does the actual selling — this file tells it what to spare. If you are ever unsure about a piece, **check it in RSL Helper before confirming a sale**.",
    "",
    "<span data-color=\"orange\">This sell file was built for a specific account. Your account may need different settings. Use the recipe overrides above to tune the behavior for your situation.</span>",
    "",
    "---",
    "## What does each account tier mean?",
    "",
    "Each tier is tuned to a different account stage and adjusts multiple settings at once — rank requirements, substat thresholds, and which sets get extra protection.",
    "",
    "- **Midgame** — You clear Normal dungeons and still rely on **5★ gear** regularly. The sell file keeps more pieces so you have gear options to work with. 5★ artifacts with decent rolls on useful substats are kept.",
    "- **Lategame** — Your main teams can clear **Hard mode** dungeons. You are mostly chasing **6★ Epic** gear now. 5★ artifacts are sold unless they roll **SPD** or come from a scarce limited set (Stoneskin, Mercurial, Feral …). 5★ accessories can still qualify. All gear types need at least **3** good substats to be worth keeping.",
    "- **Endgame** — Your roster is deep. You clear all Hard content including Cursed City, Soulcross, and Faction Wars Hard. Compared to **Lategame**, several settings tighten up: defensive and support gear now needs **4** good substats instead of **3**; average-quality drops from common sets must look promising by **level 12** rather than level 16; **Faction Wars Hard** utility gear and **Live Arena / Siege** gear are only protected at level 16; **Chaos Ore** candidates (5★ and 6★) are capped to levels 12–16 so only pieces that already rolled well are kept. On top of that, **5★** limited-set artifacts (Stoneskin, Mercurial, Feral …) and **5★** accessories are no longer kept — only their **6★** versions qualify. A few 5★ Mercurial and crit-shield pieces can still be held by Safeguards unless you also tick **Stop safeguarding 5★ gear**.",
    "",
    "---",
    "## How does the sell file decide what to keep?",
    "",
    "Rules are organized into groups. Here is what each group looks for.",
    "",
    "### Speed Priority",
    "**SPD (Speed)** is the most important substat in Raid. A piece with strong SPD rolls is worth keeping regardless of which set it comes from. This group checks every slot — Weapons, Helmets, Shields, Gauntlets, Chestplates, Boots, and **Banners** — for pieces that roll Speed as a substat.",
    "",
    "The option above controls how many good substats a piece needs.",
    "",
    "### Damage gear (for Damage Dealers)",
    "Looks for pieces with combinations of **SPD + Crit Rate (CR%) + Crit Damage (CDMG%)**. The more of these substats roll well together, the more likely the piece is kept.",
    "",
    "- **Any Set rules** — Any set qualifies. A piece from Resistance or Life can pass the same test as one from Savage, as long as the rolls are good enough.",
    "- **Limited Set rules** — Rare sets like **Stoneskin, Merciless, Mercurial, Crit Damage, Savage** get more lenient thresholds because these sets are hard to farm. Even a weaker piece from Merciless is worth saving because you cannot easily get another.",
    "- **Set Bonus rules** — If a piece missed the stricter thresholds, it gets a second chance when it belongs to a set whose bonus complements Damage dealers (e.g., Relentless for extra turns).",
    "",
    "### Survivability gear (for Support, Healers, and Tanks)",
    "Looks for **SPD + HP% + DEF% + RES** combinations. Same three-layer structure: Any Set rules, Limited Set rules (lenient thresholds for rarer sets), and Set Bonus rules (second chance for useful set-bonus sets).",
    "",
    "### Debuffer gear (for Crowd Control and Debuffer champions)",
    "Looks for **SPD + ACC** combinations. Same three-layer structure applies.",
    "",
    "### Utility sets",
    "Sets like **Stun, Provoke, Toxic, Lifesteal, Daze** are niche but can solve specific PvE challenges.  ",
    "This group saves pieces at **level 16** as long as they do not have flat substats (flat HP, ATK, or DEF are too weak to matter at this stage).  ",
    "If you have **not** finished Faction Wars Hard yet, the override above extends this protection to **all levels (0–16)** so you do not accidentally sell gear you will need later.",
    "",
    "### Scarce sets",
    "Sets available only through **Live Arena**, **Siege** — such as **Feral, Stonecleaver, Rebirth**, and **Impulse/Zeal**.  ",
    "These are protected with lenient thresholds because replacements are difficult to come by. Even a mediocre piece may be worth holding since you cannot simply farm another.",
    "",
    "### Accessories (Rings, Amulets, Banners)",
    "The rules focus on whether the **substats pair well** with that main stat.",
    "",
    "- **Banners** — Look for **SPD** as a substat. Speed is usually the main reason to use a specific banner.",
    "- **Amulets** — Look for **RES/ACC** rolls or a substat that complements a main stat (e.g., a **CDMG%** amulet wants **HP**/**DEF**/**ATK**, a **HP**/**DEF** amulet wants **DEF**/**HP**, and an **ATK** amulet wants **ACC**).",
    "- **Rings** — Substats should reinforce the ring's main stat (e.g., an HP ring wants **HP%**/**DEF%** substats).",
    "",
    "Accessories from rare sets (same sets as the Limited Set rules) get more lenient thresholds since those pieces are harder to replace.",
    "",
    "---",
    "## What are safeguards and when do they matter?",
    "",
    "**Safeguards are a safety net on top of the standard rules.** They make sure you always keep a minimum number of certain types of gear — even when none of the standard keep recipes matched the piece.",
    "",
    "**Safeguards require your RSL Helper game database.** Without it they cannot work, because they need to know what gear you already own in order to decide what to protect.",
    "",
    "Here is what some of the safeguards in this file protect:",
    "",
    "- **At least 3 pieces per useful gear set** — so you never run completely out of a set you might need.",
    "- **At least 1 banner with SPD per major faction set** — so you always have a speed-banner option for champions in that faction.",
    "- **At least 1 ring/amulet/banner per main stat per faction set** — so you can always equip any main stat combination a champion needs.",
    "- **At least 5 accessories per faction set** — enough to gear a full 5-champion Faction Wars team.",
    "- **At least 2 utility-set pieces per slot** — insurance for future events or game updates where Provoke, Stun, or similar sets might suddenly become important.",
    "",
    "<span data-color=\"orange\">**When exporting without safeguards** (for example, the standard Midgame.hsf, Lategame.hsf, or Endgame.hsf that most players distribute), these extra protections are **not** included in the exported file. The exported sell file contains only the standard keep rules.</span>",
    "",
    "---",
    "Thanks for using `RSL Helper Sellfile Creator`.  ",
    "**Good luck with your farming. May the 4× SPD rolls bless your account!**"
  ]
}